  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto prose">
    <h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
    <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> August 19, 2026</p>

    <h2>Overview</h2>
    <p>TechPulse is a free resource supported in part by affiliate partnerships. We believe in full transparency about how we earn revenue, so you can trust the recommendations we make.</p>

    <h2>What Are Affiliate Links?</h2>
    <p>Some of the links on TechPulse are affiliate links (also called referral links). This means that if you click on the link and subsequently make a purchase or sign up for a service, we may receive a small commission from the vendor at absolutely no additional cost to you.</p>

    <h2>Our Commitment to Honesty</h2>
    <p>Our editorial independence is our top priority. Affiliate partnerships do not influence our:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Product reviews or comparisons:</strong> We recommend products and services based on merit, not commission rates.</li>
      <li><strong>Content topics:</strong> We write about what we believe is most useful to our readers, not what pays the most.</li>
      <li><strong>Opinions and recommendations:</strong> Our assessments are genuinely held and based on real experience.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>If we would not personally use or recommend a product, we do not include affiliate links to it.</p>

    <h2>Identifying Affiliate Content</h2>
    <p>We clearly mark affiliate and sponsored content on our site:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Sponsored content</strong> is labeled with a "Sponsored" badge</li>
      <li><strong>Affiliate boxes</strong> include a disclaimer: "We may earn a commission if you purchase through links on this page. This does not affect our editorial independence."</li>
      <li><strong>Affiliate links in articles</strong> use <code>rel="sponsored"</code> for transparency and SEO compliance</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Current Affiliate Partners</h2>
    <p>As of the last update date, TechPulse may have affiliate relationships with the following types of services:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Web hosting and deployment platforms (e.g., Vercel, Netlify, Cloudflare)</li>
      <li>Developer tools and SaaS products</li>
      <li>Online learning platforms</li>
    </ul>
    <p>This list is not exhaustive and may change over time.</p>

    <h2>Amazon Associates / Other Programs</h2>
    <p>TechPulse may participate in additional affiliate advertising programs. These programs are designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to the respective platforms.</p>

    <h2>Questions?</h2>
    <p>If you have any questions about our affiliate relationships or this disclosure, please contact us through our GitHub repository. We are happy to provide additional clarity.</p>
  </article>
